# Per-run artefacts from `submit-migrate.sh`: the Spark log, the generated properties file, the
# generated passwd file and Spark's scratch directory. Logs are megabytes each and one is written
# per run, so they are evidence to read and quote, not history to keep. The numbers that matter get
# copied into README-ENVIRONMENT.md or docs/BENCHMARKS.md by hand, where they can be given their
# hardware.
out/
